{"Falsy check `if client_sample_rate:` silently skips `client_sample_rate = 0` - should use `if client_sample_rate is not None:` instead": 0.5615320205688477, "Cache invalidation is broken because `invalidate_upsampling_cache` only invalidates one specific combination of project_ids, but a project can appear in many different query-time project sets with distinct cache keys": 0.8526515960693359, "The `invalidate_upsampling_cache` function is never invoked anywhere in the PR, so cache invalidation on allowlist changes never actually fires": 0.9173606634140015, "Redundant variable `upsampling_enabled` is a direct alias for `should_upsample` adding no clarity": 0.07119982689619064, "`transform_query_columns_for_error_upsampling(query_columns)` is duplicated across three separate branches instead of being called once before branching": 0.08325511962175369, "Inline comments say 'has 1 event' but assertions check for count of 10 - should reflect that 1 event is upsampled by factor of 10 due to sample_rate=0.1": 0.18686851859092712, "`self.user` is overwritten after `login_as` in setUp, making `self.authed_user` the only safe reference to the authenticated user - subsequent code using `self.user` references the wrong unauthenticated user": 0.646700382232666}